{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's a ridiculous idea to try and defeat me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So frustrating."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's so nice up here!"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't believe we're having this festival.",
                "It's the best!"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eep! Orin?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why are you here?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "|\tThere's so many treasures \t,\taboveground\t,here",
                "There's so many treasures aboveground!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You could've told me about this",
                "Great Phantasmagorial Release Festival!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's my favorite thing!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We're both Underworld dwellers,",
                "you don't have to give me the cold shoulder like that!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't like cats.",
                "You should know that."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What're you talking about?",
                "I don't eat rodents!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, not living rodents."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not so good with cats."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now that I think of it, Lady Shou is also a type of cat."
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Human Village is also flooded with phantoms!"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There might even be some vengeful spirits mixed among the phantoms..."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But probably not."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Orin?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't get too close to the village, okay?",
                "At least not while bringing that many phantoms."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's fine, this place is full of phantoms anyway.",
                "I'll blend in just fine."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't think blending in or not",
                "is the problem."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll head home right after I fill up",
                "my cart with phantoms, or maybe corpses!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't you think you're overfishing?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, it's about time to go home!",
                "My cart is now full of captured phantoms!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You might as well do me a favor",
                "and catch <i$all> of the phantoms."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You might as well do me a favor",
                "and catch <i$all> of the phantoms."
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh my, what a big harvest!"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm definitely gonna come back again to",
                "that all-you-can-grab phantom fest."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?",
                "Who's that over there..."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? Who're you?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, it's you, Orin."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Thought there was someone I didn't know.",
                "Didn't expect to see a nine-tailed fox."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I often see you playing with my dear little Chen. I am grateful for that."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahh, no problem."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Thanks to you, my once cute little Chen is",
                "now finding corpses for fun."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nyaaahaha!",
                "The training was worth it!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, need anything from me?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Do you know anything about the incident",
                "happening on the surface?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Incident...",
                "Ah, you must mean the Great Phantasmagorial Release Festival?"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It rocks!",
                "The scent of death was everywhere!"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I never thought there'd be such a fancy",
                "event on the surface."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who's the organizer?",
                "Could it be that one from your place?"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, I'm sorry, never mind me.",
                "You're not someone who'll get what I'm talking about."
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You came here to investigate the phantoms?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Investigating on the surface alone was fruitless."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll tell you something nice!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems like new phantoms are coming out",
                "from the depths far below."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "New phantoms are coming out, you say.",
                "Thank you for the fine information."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They are like the husks of vengeful spirits, ",
                "whose grudge and everything else have faded..."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They aren't to my liking."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well,",
                "Time to kick the mood up and start working."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "From now on, stop playing with corpses",
                "when you're with Chen!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "|\tI didn't expect I'd have to come out to \t,\tthe Former Hell of Blood Pools\t,place like this",
                "I didn't expect I'd have to come out to the Former Hell of Blood Pools..."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not gonna be able to slip right past her, am I?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hellooo? Where are you?",
                "Chiyari, the Tenkajiiin."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Argh, what's that?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yooo, Orinǃ",
                "Long time no see, how've you been?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What're you up to today?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Not much. I'm just here to warn you that randos might be coming by.",
                "They're investigating the incident happening on the surface."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A fox from the surface was bugging me not too long ago.",
                "It's only a matter of time before the shrine maiden's here."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whaaat?",
                "There's an incident on the surfaaace?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You don't know?",
                "That new beast, Toutetsu, has gotta be the culprit, right?"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's gonna be <i$another> fierce battle!"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You might get caught up in it.",
                "Maybe you should hide for a bit."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heheheh.",
                "Now you're joking."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How's anyone supposed to hide in a place",
                "that looks like the apocalypse."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Not to mention that Toutetsu and I have become friends."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wha—!?"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you surprised?",
                "You're looking at a proud member of the Gouyoku Alliance."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wha... What?",
                "Huh!?"
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see. If so, our fight seems inevitable."
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?",
                "I thought you'd fight me no matter what."
            ]
        },
        "280_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahaha, of course.",
                "After all..."
            ]
        },
        "288_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No battles, no corpses!"
            ]
        },
        "296_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You get meǃ"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That was fun!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That fox I mentioned should be here soon to investigate."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Speaking of which, where's Toutetsu now?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She should be in the Animal Realm.",
                "She said conquering the surface requires a lot of preparation and blablabla..."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've already gone this far,",
                "I may as well go say hi to Toutetsu."
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That was fun!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whoa, when did the Animal Realm become this fabulous?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't complain if these people called Former Hell the boonies."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heeeeey, Toutetsuuuu.",
                "Are you heeere?"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who's calling me so frankly?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "As I thought. Orin from the Palace of the Earth Spirits.",
                "It's rare to see you here."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What do you want?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Y'know, that incident on the surface,",
                "you're behind it, right?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Incident, you say.",
                "If so, what're you gonna do?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Phantoms were everywhere! It was awesome!"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Just to tell you that.",
                "I really appreciate it."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heh, what the hell are you saying?",
                "Some kinda joke?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However, I'll not claim that deed."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's not me, and I don't do things",
                "like spreading phantoms on the surface."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Since you've been making new friends,",
                "I thought you were up to something."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you met Tenkajin?",
                "Actually, you've probably known her longer than I."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah? We're buddies."
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well then, It's time for a test."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's enough."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're just an ordinary Kasha."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Obviously, but",
                "what were you testing anyway?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That Tenkajin. She came to me all of a sudden.",
                "Said she wanted to join me."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Really? Chiyari?",
                "Hard to say whether that's out of character or not..."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There was no reason to turn her down,",
                "so I just let her be. However..."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The blood she's been accumulating",
                "was mixed with some suspicious test tubes."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Suspicious test tubes...?"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have some here.",
                "Wanna take a look?"
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ooookay...?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Come on, closer."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I misjudged.",
                "She's not following anyone's order."
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "... Where am I?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I know the feel from this pungent smell...!"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm in Hell!"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see the kitten is finally awake."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have been watching you from the very beginning."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That Toutetsu is a wicked one."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That she would pretend to open her heart,",
                "only to lure you into a trap. Despicable!"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "T-trap?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, that teleportation trap earlier...",
                "Or something, I'm not sure."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, now I remember!",
                "That fearless face of yours!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're that one human who took over Hell all by herself!",
                "Zanmu Nippaku!"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Indeed."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was also you who abolished the old Hell and founded Former Hell in the process.",
                "I'm honored to meet you."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm-hmm."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you come to waste my time reminiscing?"
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not here by choice!"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait, am I here by choice?",
                "... No."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You already know of me,",
                "so you already know of what is to come."
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you stand before me,",
                "there will be no escape."
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just as everything else, you too will dance in the palm of my hand.",
                "And the curtain will fall."
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The world proceeds as I planned."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How pitiful."
            ]
        }
    }
}